  "title": "Seneca Foods Reports Sales and Earnings for the Quarter and Nine Months Ended December 28, 2024",
  "summary": "“We are pleased with the continued unit volume sales growth experienced in the third quarter, up over 16% compared to last year. However, margins remain pressured versus last year due to the poor 2024 pack season, driven by historic rainy weather in our primary growing areas,” stated Paul Palmby, President and Chief Executive Officer of Seneca Foods.",
